### 1. 登录 (获取门禁卡)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin01&password=123456

### 2. 用门禁卡访问管理员接口 (这里的 Cookie 会自动带上)
GET http://localhost:8080/user/teachers




POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new_student",
  "password": "my_password_123",
  "realName": "新同学",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}



### 1. 新增教师用户
POST http://localhost:8080/user/create
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "username": "teacher_li",
  "password": "password456",
  "realName": "李华",
  "role": "TEACHER"
}

### 2. 根据 ID 查询用户 (假设刚才生成的 ID 是 3)
GET http://localhost:8080/user/3

### 3. 获取所有教师列表
GET http://localhost:8080/user/teachers

### 4. 更新用户信息
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 3,
  "password": "newpassword789",
  "realName": "李华(已修改)",
  "role": "TEACHER"
}

### 5. 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:8080/user/3


### 1. 提交一条签到记录
POST http://localhost:8080/attendance/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "20210001",
  "studentName": "张三",
  "courseId": "CS101",
  "status": "NORMAL"
}

### 2. 查询张三的签到历史
GET http://localhost:8080/attendance/history/20210001


###分页查询
### 测试分页查询 - 第一页，每页3条
GET http://localhost:8080/attendance/page?page=0&size=3

### 测试分页查询 - 第二页，每页3条
GET http://localhost:8080/attendance/page?page=1&size=3

### 测试特定学生的分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/attendance/page?page=0&size=2&studentId=20210001


###
GET http://localhost:8080/attendance/page?sortField=studentId&direction=asc

###
GET http://localhost:8080/attendance/page?sortField=checkInTime&direction=desc

###
http://localhost:8080/attendance/search?studentId=20210001

